     the preview panel reads as a bit taller than the list next to it
     rather than pinned exactly to it. The card(s) inside are centered in
     whatever that stretched-plus-margin height works out to. */
  .group-preview {
    position: relative;
    /* Wide enough for the Charcuterie Chats diagonal pair (dx up to
       ±72px on a 240px card) to clear the panel's own edge with margin
       to spare before the 5rem gap to the list even starts. */
    flex: 0 0 300px;
